From: Nerves system for the SMT1019
Subject: [PATCH] dts: rk3576 wf1019: enable the DW watchdog

The SoC dtsi declares watchdog@2ace0000 (snps,dw-wdt) but leaves it
disabled and no board dts enables it, so /dev/watchdog0 never appears
and Erlang heart runs without a hardware watchdog. Enable it; the
kernel builds with WATCHDOG_NOWAYOUT so it cannot be disarmed once
heart opens it.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3576s-r157-v2.0-wf1019-linux.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3576s-r157-v2.0-wf1019-linux.dts
@@ -826,3 +826,7 @@
 &vp0 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
+
+&wdt {
+	status = "okay";
+};
